UID:10063341-1779472800-1779480000@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Awen Family Band | Fridays In The RAD Music Series
DESCRIPTION:Join us this Friday May 22 for the Boogie Woogie sounds of Awen Family Band. Come celebrate the beginning of the weekend with great sounds\, refreshing beverages and great tacos! Show starts at 6pm and is free for everyone!\n\nAwen Family Band is a nationally touring world boogie collective founded by singer-songwriter and coddie-wompler Tim Husk in the summer of 2019 .The band has featured an ever-changing all-star cast. Blending roots music from around the globe such as Zydeco\, Bluegrass\, Funk\, West African Traditional Music\, Old Time\, Indie\, Swing\, Celtic\, Folk\, Psychedelic\, Jam\, Boogie and many more\, topped with their own unique sound and lyrics to spread the message for all who seek to hear.\n\n\n\n\nRecords in the RAD in the River Arts District is a thoughtfully curated record store with an eclectic selection of vinyl\, both new and used. In addition to records\, we also have a music inspired art gallery\, which features artwork from Brian\, Dylan and Susan Haynes. recordsintherad.com \nAt Wedge Brewing\, we got our start in the River Arts District\, and therefore hold art and community very close to us. We create beer for the creatives and give them a place to commune. wedgebrewing.com \n  \nScreenshot\n  \n  \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/awen-family-band-fridays-in-the-rad-music-series/
LOCATION:Records in the RAD/The Wedge
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
